      "text": "OF THESE THREE POINTS : OF THE"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 4,
      "role": "subtitle",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "tranſlation of Holy Scriptures into the vulgar ton-",
      "line_end_hyphen": true
    },
    {
      "line_index": 5,
      "role": "subtitle",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "gues , and namely into English ; of the cauſes"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 6,
      "role": "subtitle",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "why this New Teſtament is tranſlated"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 7,
      "role": "subtitle",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "according to the ancient vulgar Latin"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 8,
      "role": "subtitle",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "text ; and of the manner of tranſla-",
      "line_end_hyphen": true
    },
    {
      "line_index": 9,
      "role": "subtitle",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "ting the ſame,"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 10,
      "role": "excluded",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "T",
      "note": "ornamental initial; word is THE (prose continues 'HE holy Bible')",
      "excluded_reason": "reviewer removed (empty correction)"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 11,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "THE holy Bible long ſince tranſlated by vs into English,",
      "_pre_review": "HE holy Bible long ſince tranſlated by vs into English,",
      "reviewed": true
    },
    {
      "line_index": 12,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "and the old Teſtament lying by vs for lack of good meanes"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 13,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "to publish the whole in ſuch ſort as a work of ſo great"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 14,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "charge and importance requireth ; we haue yet through"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 15,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "God's goodnes at length fully finished for thee (moſt"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 16,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "Chriſtian Reader) al the NEW TESTAMENT ;"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 17,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "which is the principal , moſt profitable , & comfortable",
      "has_uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "line_index": 18,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "peece of holy Writ : and, as wel for al other inſtitution of"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 19,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "life and doctrine , as ſpecially for deciding the doubts of"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 20,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "theſe daies, more proper and pregnant then the other part"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 21,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "not yet printed."
    },
    {
      "line_index": 22,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "VVhich tranſlation vve doe not for al that publish, vpon erroneous opinion 1. of neceſ-",
      "line_end_hyphen": true
    },
    {
      "line_index": 23,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "ſitie , that the holy Scriptures should alvvayes be in our mother tongue , or 2. that they"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 24,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "ought , or vvere ordained by God , to be read indifferently of al , or 3. could be eaſily"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 25,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "vnderſtood of euery one that readeth or heareth them in a knovven language ; or 4. that"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 26,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "they vvere not often, through man's malice or infirmitie, pernicious and much hurtful to",
      "has_uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "line_index": 27,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "many ; 5. or that vve generally and abſolutely deemed it more conuenient in it-ſelf , &"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 28,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "more agreable to God's vvord and honour , or edification, of the faithful, to haue them"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 29,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "turned into vulgar tongues , then to be kept & ſtudied only in the Eccleſiaſtical learned"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 30,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "languages : Not for theſe nor any ſuch like cauſes doe vve tranſlate this ſacred Booke ;"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 31,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "but vpon ſpecial conſideration of the preſent time, ſtate, and condition of our countrie ,"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 32,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "vnto vvhich diuers things are either neceſſarie , or profitable and medicinable novv ,"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 33,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "that othervviſe in the peace of the Church vvere neither much requiſit , not perchance"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 34,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "vvholy tolerable."
    },
    {
      "line_index": 35,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "1. In this matter, to marke only the vviſedom & moderation of holy Church and the"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 36,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "Gouernours therof on the one ſide , and the indiſcrete zeale of the popular , and their"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 37,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "factious leaders, on the other, is a high point of prudence. Theſe later , partly of ſim-",
      "line_end_hyphen": true
    },
    {
      "line_index": 38,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "plicitie, partly of curioſitie, and ſpecially of pride & diſobedience, haue made claime in"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 39,
      "role": "prose",
      "column": "L",
      "text": "this caſe for the common people, vvith plauſible pretences many, but good reaſons none"
    },
